    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"StrengthGame.cs.11705","source":"Wow. Zero strength. I'm actually impressed with how weak you are. Here's a star token.","translation":"哇，力量是零。你竟然能弱成這樣，真讓我佩服。拿一枚星星代幣吧。"},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"TitleMenu.cs.11717","source":"Welcome back!","translation":"歡迎回來！"},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"TitleMenu.cs.11718","source":"Plug in an Xbox One or Xbox 360 controller to activate game pad mode.","translation":"連接Xbox One或Xbox 360控制器以啟用控制器模式。"},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"TitleMenu.cs.11719","source":"Tip: Giving gifts is a good way to make friends with the residents of Stardew Valley.","translation":"提示：送禮是和星露谷居民交朋友的好方法。"},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"TitleMenu.cs.11720","source":"Tip: Shift-click to purchase 5 items at a time.","translation":"提示：按住Shift並點擊，一次購買5件物品。"},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"TitleMenu.cs.11721","source":"After upgrading your hoe or watering can, hold down the tool button to increase the area of effect!","translation":"鋤頭或澆水壺升級後，按住工具按鈕就能擴大作用範圍！"},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"TitleMenu.cs.11722","source":"Tip: Right-click to use a weapon's special move.","translation":"提示：按滑鼠右鍵可使用武器的特殊招式。"},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"TitleMenu.cs.11723","source":"Watch TV shows to learn useful tips, cooking recipes, and more!","translation":"觀看電視節目，學習實用提示、烹飪食譜和更多內容！"},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"TitleMenu.cs.11724","source":"The traveling merchant visits Stardew Valley twice a week. She sells a wide variety of goods, often at exorbitant prices!","translation":"旅行商人每週造訪星露谷兩次。她出售各式各樣的商品，但價格往往高得驚人！"},
